tom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQEQ\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjRyYP62pWXAxWPkeEIHfE7G9gQi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAR\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" class=\"\" data-bfc=\"\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQEg\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\">According to the <span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><a style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);\" href=\"https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/paragraph\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQEw\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjRyYP62pWXAxWPkeEIHfE7G9gQy_kOegoIAggACAAIChAT\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"H23r4e\">Merriam-Webster Definition</a></span></span>, it starts on a new line and visually breaks text into manageable, cohesive chunks.<br></div></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font